<view class="page-shell design-page cook-page">
  <view class="design-hero"><view class="design-copy"><text class="eyebrow">做完再记 · 不用算克数</text><view class="page-title">{{recipeName || '这次做菜'}}</view></view><view class="hero-picture"><kitchen-art name="{{recipeName}}" kind="eggsDish" art-size="hero-illustration" size="228" /></view></view>
  <text class="cook-intro" wx:if="{{!submitted}}">选这次实际使用的批次，再确认用完或有剩。取消不会改变冰箱库存。</text>
  <view class="loading-note" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在核对菜单和冰箱…</view>
  <view class="cloud-error-card paper-card" wx:if="{{loadError}}"><text class="cloud-error-message">{{loadError}}</text><button class="secondary-button cloud-error-retry" bindtap="loadData" disabled="{{loading || submitting}}">重新核对</button></view>
  <view class="confirmation-notice" wx:if="{{reconfirmRequired}}">冰箱批次有变化，请重新核对选择和“是否用完”，再点击确认。不会自动重试记录。</view>
  <view class="confirmation-notice" wx:if="{{outcomeUncertain}}">正在等待原确认的记录结果，保留原批次和选择。重试只查询这次记录，不重复记账。</view>
  <block wx:if="{{!submitted}}">
    <view class="paper-card ingredient-card" wx:for="{{ingredients}}" wx:key="name">
      <view class="ingredient-heading"><kitchen-art name="{{item.name}}" art-size="small-illustration" size="100" /><text class="section-title">{{item.name}}</text></view>
      <view class="missing-batch" wx:if="{{!item.batches.length}}"><text>没有可用批次</text><text>先去冰箱补记实际使用的食材，再回来确认。</text></view>
      <view class="batch-choice {{batch.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{item.batches}}" wx:for-item="batch" wx:key="id">
        <checkbox-group data-id="{{batch.id}}" bindchange="selectBatch"><label class="choice-label"><checkbox value="selected" checked="{{batch.selected}}" disabled="{{loading || loadError || submitting || submitted || outcomeUncertain}}" color="#18332f" /><view class="batch-copy"><text class="batch-date">保质期至 {{batch.expiryLabel}}</text><text class="subtle">{{batch.statusLabel}} · {{batch.selected ? '这次使用' : '这次未选'}}</text></view></label></checkbox-group>
        <view class="remaining-row" wx:if="{{batch.selected}}"><text class="remaining-label">这次使用后：</text><view class="remaining-options"><button class="remaining-option {{batch.usedUp ? 'used-up' : ''}}" data-id="{{batch.id}}" data-value="usedUp" bindtap="chooseRemaining" disabled="{{loading || loadError || submitting || submitted || outcomeUncertain}}">用完</button><button class="remaining-option {{!batch.usedUp ? 'has-left' : ''}}" data-id="{{batch.id}}" data-value="remaining" bindtap="chooseRemaining" disabled="{{loading || loadError || submitting || submitted || outcomeUncertain}}">有剩</button></view></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="design-empty paper-card" wx:if="{{!loading && !loadError && !ingredients.length}}"><kitchen-art kind="book" art-size="empty-illustration" size="230" /><text class="subtle">这道菜的菜单快照没有食材记录，无法确认做菜消耗。</text></view>
  </block>
  <view class="error-text" wx:if="{{submitError}}">{{submitError}}</view>
  <view class="paper-card result-card" wx:if="{{submitted}}"><kitchen-art kind="table" art-size="empty-illustration" size="230" /><text class="section-title">做菜消耗已记录</text><text class="result-row" wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="id">{{item.name}}：{{item.remaining ? '仍有剩余' : '这批已用完'}} · {{item.statusLabel}}</text><text class="subtle">未用完的批次仍有剩余，采购单继续沿用菜谱的“是否用完”规则。</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="openFridge">查看冰箱和记录</button></view>
  <view class="design-toolbar cook-toolbar" wx:else><button class="primary-button" bindtap="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting || loading || !canSubmit}}">{{outcomeUncertain ? '重试 · 确认原记录结果' : '做完了 · 确认记录'}}</button><view class="toolbar-links"><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{submitting}}">取消</button><button class="fridge-button" bindtap="openFridge" disabled="{{submitting}}">先去冰箱录入食材</button></view></view>
</view>
